# Onboard parameters for IPS Phase 1 (EKF2 external-vision + offboard)
#
# Target: PX4 v1.17.0 (ubicoders fork), FMUv5 (px4_fmu-v5_default)
# Params-only config: route the host IPS into EKF2 as the external-vision (EV)
# aiding source and disable GNSS for indoor flight. NO firmware source changes.
#
# Apply with QGroundControl: Vehicle Setup -> Parameters -> Tools ->
#   "Load from file" -> select this file -> write -> REBOOT the vehicle.
# (Or via nsh `param set` / `param save` / `reboot`; see apply_params.md.)
#
# Type codes (QGC .params format): INT32 = 6, FLOAT = 9.
# QGC ignores lines beginning with '#'; only the tab-separated rows are imported.
#
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
#
# --- External-vision (EV) aiding: feed IPS pos+vel into EKF2 ---
# EKF2_EV_CTRL bitmask: bit0 horiz pos + bit1 vert pos + bit2 3D vel = 1+2+4 = 7.
# Yaw bit (bit3=8) intentionally OFF: IPS attitude unused, slow yaw drift accepted.
1	1	EKF2_EV_CTRL	7	6
# EKF2_HGT_REF enum: 0=Baro 1=GPS 2=Range 3=Vision. Use 3 (Vision) so the IPS
# vertical position is the primary height. Switch to 2 (Range) ONLY if a
# rangefinder over a flat floor is added. reboot_required.
1	1	EKF2_HGT_REF	3	6
# EKF2_EV_NOISE_MD: 0=use variance from message (param as lower bound), 1=use
# params directly. IPS ODOMETRY carries no covariance -> set 1 (param noise).
1	1	EKF2_EV_NOISE_MD	1	6
# EKF2_EVP_NOISE: EV position measurement noise. yaml default 0.1 m.
# TUNE on the bench against the observed IPS position jitter.
1	1	EKF2_EVP_NOISE	0.1	9
# EKF2_EVV_NOISE: EV velocity measurement noise. yaml default 0.1 m/s.
# TUNE on the bench against the observed IPS velocity jitter.
1	1	EKF2_EVV_NOISE	0.1	9
# EKF2_EV_DELAY: IPS->autopilot latency (ms). yaml default 0.0 ms.
# MEASURE on the bench (round-trip / timestamp offset) and set the real value.
# reboot_required.
1	1	EKF2_EV_DELAY	0.0	9
# --- Disable GNSS for indoor flight ---
# EKF2_GPS_CTRL bitmask (default 7). Set 0 to disable all GNSS aiding indoors.
1	1	EKF2_GPS_CTRL	0	6
